OL,3,ANearly 600 women killed in South Africa
OL,4,Awithin three months
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly 600 women were killed in South
OL,7,FAfrica between July and September this
OL,8,Fyear, according to the country's latest
OL,9,Fcrime statistics.
OL,11,FThis figure includes 13 women whose
OL,12,Fpartially naked and bruised bodies were
OL,13,Ffound dumped in public areas in and
OL,14,Faround Johannesburg.
OL,16,FThe murders triggered national outrage
OL,17,Fand police faced pressure to find the
OL,18,Fculprits, in a country with one of the
OL,19,Fhighest rates of gender-based violence
OL,20,Fand murder rates in the world.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
